rem Test recording control commands
rem Validates OBS RECORDING START and OBS RECORDING STOP

rem Test 1: Start recording
OBS RECORDING START
wait 1ms

rem Test 2: Stop recording
OBS RECORDING STOP
wait 1ms

rem Test 3: Start and stop multiple times
OBS RECORDING START
wait 1ms
OBS RECORDING STOP
wait 1ms

OBS RECORDING START
wait 1ms
OBS RECORDING STOP
wait 1ms

rem Test 4: Recording with effects
OBS RECORDING START
effect "Sharp Pixels"
wait 1ms
effect "Soft CRT"
wait 1ms
OBS RECORDING STOP
wait 1ms

stop
